<string name="manage_all_files">
Ghost Commander is a file manager app and it needs a special system
permission (MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE) which provides the necessary authority to perform the file access and modification operations
which are core essential functions of a file manager.\n
You, as the owner of the system are in command of giving such permission to the Ghost Commander application.\n
If you agree, please tap the OK button, then you will be redirected to the system level settings screen where you should allow Ghost Commander to manage all files.
If you do not agree, please tap the CANCEL, the abilities of the applications would be limited. However, you would still be able to use the SAF mode to perform some file operations.</string>
